# ── SMS Pasal (bulk SMS) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# The backend SMS service (server/services/sms-pasal.ts) reads BOTH values from
# the environment AT CALL TIME — they are never hardcoded in source.
#
# SMS_PASAL_API_KEY   (required)  The X-API-Key issued by SMS Pasal. Sent as the
#                                 `X-API-Key` request header.
# SMS_PASAL_ENDPOINT  (optional)  The send endpoint. Defaults to the documented
#                                 one below when unset.
#
# If SMS_PASAL_API_KEY is missing the app still works normally: every send
# returns a clear "skipped / not configured" result, the attempt is logged, and
# nothing throws or crashes. The SMS status indicator shows "Not configured".
#
# NOTE: a key beginning `nsms_test_` is a TEST key — SMS Pasal only delivers it
# to numbers registered to your organisation. Use a live key to text customers.
SMS_PASAL_API_KEY=''
SMS_PASAL_ENDPOINT='https://api.smspasal.com/api/v1/sms/send'
